e","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"24YT8pH4s8fX2kUzFibYIQ","review_id":"aFDHylHDwQD5uLRviXR9kg","date":"2020-09-13T03:31:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9406564831733704,"text_excerpt":"I've heard about this place prior to the one opening here. I love sushi and always wanted to go to this place, but there was never one here in the city. Until now! Checked out the menu and I love the theme of the restaurant. Walked in to place a to go order. I ordered the Spicy Crawfish Roll and the Thriller Roll. The Thriller Roll, named after the classic Michael Jackson hit \"Thriller\" of course. The servers were friendly, service was fast, and the ambience was great. Reminded he of Hard Rock Cafe, but it's a sushi based menu. If that's ok for me to say. I came home, opened the containers with the sushi, took one bite, and i was hooked! It tasted so good, and I was satisfied once finishe..."},{"business_id":"24YT8pH4s8fX2kUzFibYIQ","review_id":"Sws1rdesDAzbjzLQlCjNnQ","date":"2021-04-12T15:19:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9365397691726685,"text_excerpt":"This spot is located inside the river walk, I went on a date here, and when I tell you I was totally impressed. The sushi was the freshest I've ever had, the heart roll is to die for. The atmosphere is funk and there's an amazing Mississippi River view. The staff is polite and food comes out fresh and fast. The menu cover is old album cover."},{"business_id":"24YT8pH4s8fX2kUzFibYIQ","review_id":"8a4yK2f9brgbD9WaKwm-KA","date":"2021-02-05T21:38:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.915299654006958,"text_excerpt":"Great place to eat in the Riverwalk mall. (And one of the healthier places to eat if you are shopping and need a bite to eat). I had a crunchy shrimp roll. It wasn't the best or worst that I've ever had. The staff was incredibly friendly and very fast with service. They were noticeably cleaning everything very well and were following covid protocols. There is seating inside the restaurant and also outside within the mall corridor. Strangely, the only serve sweet tea (no unsweet). I was told that this is because they barely sold any unsweet and would end up throwing it out."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"24YT8pH4s8fX2kUzFibYIQ","photo_id":"RzJr4kPqCmbuCGHNpJH8wg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/RzJr4kPqCmbuCGHNpJH8wg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8915122151374817},{"business_id":"24YT8pH4s8fX2kUzFibYIQ","photo_id":"se3nXadTg1uf05oUHkPeoQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/se3nXadTg1uf05oUHkPeoQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8661375641822815},{"business_id":"24YT8pH4s8fX2kUzFibYIQ","photo_id":"R-fza3uXK0hSW6bar19l9A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/R-fza3uXK0hSW6bar19l9A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8595170378684998},{"business_id":"24YT8pH4s8fX2kUzFibYIQ","photo_id":"gi8-O1GhLdjKBIiHzYpATA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/gi8-O1GhLdjKBIiHzYpATA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8441933989524841},{"business_id":"24YT8pH4s8fX2kUzFibYIQ","photo_id":"s8PmW1nvV2KN38DgdMpyDg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/s8PmW1nvV2KN38DgdMpyDg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7941723465919495}]},"notebook_case":null}
